omarchy-airpods backend (airpodsd)
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

This backend contains protocol and cryptographic routines adapted from
LibrePods, copyright Kavish Devar and LibrePods contributors, licensed under
the GNU General Public License version 3 or (at your option) any later version.
Upstream: https://github.com/kavishdevar/librepods
Sources: linux-rust/src/bluetooth/aacp.rs, linux-rust/src/bluetooth/le.rs,
linux-rust/src/utils.rs; corroborating proximity layout from
linux/ble/blemanager.cpp.

Modifications in this project: a headless, device-specific policy daemon;
bounds-checked protocol parsing; private independent key storage; singleton
local control socket; explicit enrollment; IRK-resolved advertisement
identity; conservative in-ear connection authorization; full disconnection
and BlueZ blocking when not authorized; MPRIS pause/resume on single-bud
removal/reinsertion with per-player resume ownership; no GUI, tray,
raw-packet/key logging, feature flags or unrelated firmware writes.

